		Attribute: { 
			Name: {
				Fireball: Fireball
				Incinerating: Incinerating
				Scorching: Scorching
				Enthusiasm: Enthusiasm
				Gelidity: Gelidity
				Iceflake: Iceflake
				Glacier: Glacier
				Charging: Charging
				LightningChain: LightningChain
				Overload: Overload
				SilveryArrow: SilveryArrow
				Sanctity: Sanctity
				Exorcism: Exorcism
			}
			Desc: {
				Fireball: Shoots a fireball condensed by magic
				Incinerating: Makes targets on fire, and generates a fire explosion, dealing [damage=36] AoE magic damage
				Scorching: Applys [{$Mods.CNC.Buff.Name.Scorched}] to targets when strikes, decreasing target's defense by 8
				Enthusiasm: 2% chance to trigger [{$Mods.CNC.Buff.Name.Enthused}] when you attack
				Gelidity: Reduces target's movement speed
				Iceflake: Generates an extra explosion, and deals [damage=14] AoE magic damage
				Glacier: Your attacks may freeze your targets when strikes
				Charging: Shoots a lightning missile
				SpellLightningChain: Right click to shoot a lightning chain, and attacks {0} targets, dealing [damage=50] magic damage
				ArcaneOverload: Increases magic damage by 3% when strikes targets, it will be cleared when increased to 30%, and shoots a overloaded missile next time, dealing [damage=40] AoE magic damage
				SpellReconstruction:Attacks have a 5% chance to instantly rebuild and cast the Spell Chain Lightning charm
				SpellAugmentated:Improved spell research to increase chain lightning target by 1 and search radius by 5
				StableSpell:Overload will be able to hold for 5s
				SilveryArrow: Wooden arrows turn into Silvery Arrows
				Sanctity: 45% shoots an Sanctified Arrow, making [damage=2f] ranged damage and applying [{$Mods.CNC.Buff.Name.Sanctified}] to targets
				Exorcism: Explodes all Sanctified Arrows if the target was struck by 3 Sanctified Arrows, dealing [damage=3f] ranged damage
			}
		}

