		ClassPreview: {
			Barbarian: \0{$Mods.CNC.Class.Barbarian}: New [Rage] Ability\n\n[Resentment] Talent: \n*When taken damage from enemies or dealing damage to enemies, gains 1 [Rage] stack, this talent can be triggered once every 0.4s\n*While in possession of the maximum [Rage] stacks, enters [Wrath], and [Rage] stacks begin to lose 3 per second\n*While in [Wrath], exits [Wrath] and enters [Cowardice] for 5s if your [Rage] stacks less than 5\n\n[Wrath] State: \n*20% increased attack and movement speed\n*10% increased damage\n\n[Cowardice] State: \n*20% decreased attack and movement speed\n*10% decreased damage\n*Cannot gains any [Rage] stacks
			Defender: \0
			Crusader: \0{$Mods.CNC.Class.Crusader}: New [Blessing] Ability\n\nEquipping a faith emblem to trigger a [Faith] talent, [Blessing] stacks will restore continuously\nWhen [Blessing] stacks less than 20%, enters [Blasphemy]\n\n[Fanatic Faith] Talent: \n*Increases melee damage by [Blessing] stacks\n\n[Divine Faith] Talent: \n*Increases magic damage by [Blessing] stacks\n\n[Blasphemy] State: \n*20% decreased movement speed and dealt damage\n*10% increased taken damage
			Ranger: \0{$Mods.CNC.Class.Ranger}: New [Power] Ability\n\n[Vicinity Ineptitude] Talent: \n*When any enemies close to, enters [Fluster]\n\n[Power Accumulation] Talent: \n*Increases arrow damage and critical strike chance by [Power] stacks, and shooting will exhaust [Power] stacks\n*[Power] stacks will restore continuously, its initial full restoring time is 4s\n*While in possession of the maximum [Power] stacks, increases arrow damage by 60% and increases arrow critial sprike chance by 30% currently\n\n[Fluster] State: \n*30% decreased arrow damage\n*10% decreased arrow critical strike chance
			Gunman: \0
			Thrower: \0
			Musketeer: \0{$Mods.CNC.Class.Musketeer}: New [Durability] Ability\n\nSpends some time restoring [Durability] stacks when [Durability] stacks is exhausted\nPresses Class Key to enter or exit [Restoring]\n\n[Bullet Energy] Talent: \n*Requires 1 [Durability] stack every shooting, \n*Counts restoring time according to weapon use time when shooting\n\n[Precision Strike] Talent:\n*Increases critial strike chance by 10%\n*Increases movement speed by 15%\n*Increases dealt damage by 25% to enemies that life more than 75%\n\n[Restoring] State: \n*35% decreased movement speed\n*20% increased taken damage\n*If [Durability] stacks is less than 35%, cannot exit this state or shooting
			Cleric: \0{$Mods.CNC.Class.Cleric}: New [Blessing] Ability\n\nEquipping a faith emblem to trigger a [Faith] talent, [Blessing] stacks will restore continuously\nWhen [Blessing] stacks less than 20%, enters [Blasphemy]\n\n[Angelic Faith] Talent: \n*Increases regen amount by [Blessing] stacks\n\n[Divine Faith] Talent: \n*Increases magic damage by [Blessing] stacks\n\n[Blasphemy] State: \n*20% decreased movement speed and dealt damage\n*10% increased taken damage
			Wizard: \0
			SpellBreaker: \0
			Druid: \0
			Shaman: \0
			Warlock: \0
			Monk: \0
			Assassin: \0{$Mods.CNC.Class.Assassin}: New [Phantom] Ability\n\nWhile in possession of the maximum [Phantom] stacks, presses Class Key to trigger [Wraith]\nWhen [Wraith] is triggered, taken damage from enemies decrease to 1, and will not exhaust [Phantom] stacks instantly\n\n[Wraith] State: \n*40% increased movement speed, 50% increased raid damage and [Phantom] stacks lose continuously\n*If taken damage from enemies, exhausts [Phantom] stacks instantly, exits this state when [Phantom] stacks will be exhausted
		}

